      "content": "it's just that... the \"rest\" you're talking about, it doesn't feel like something I can just do by sitting in a dark room. it feels like it needs to be permanent. if everything is hollow, then why am i still stuck in this body, still feeling this weight? if the only honest thing left is to let go, isn't that what actually ends the struggle?",
